ikc classic), + kidney shot + blind which will make rogues very good for CC in dungeons. One problem is people often dont appreciate rogue CC very much and would rather take a mage in a lot of cases. Rogues #1 problem in classic was that they didnt have enough going for them to make them attractive to most people for picking in 5 mans and they competed with warrior tanks for gear which put them in a very bad spot as far as finding groups goes, it might be better in forever in that regard because of more paladin tanks. Maybe worse because more druid tanks will mean more competition for leather?<br><br>As far as pvp goes i think you are better off just going druid for the stealth power fantasy.","time":1789777328,"resto":581529693},{"no":581530386,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:22:08","name":"Anonymous","com":"STOP FUCKING SHARDING ME WHEN EVERYONE DROPS GROUP AND I HAVEN&#039;T LOOTED EVERYTHING<br>FUCKING RETARDED SHIT","time":1789777328,"resto":581529693},{"no":581530398,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:22:17","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;it&#039;s open<\/span><br>nani des ka?!!!","filename":"ttgmisxsacqh1","ext":".jpg","w":2560,"h":1440,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789777337997467,"time":1789777337,"md5":"+LovH3z3B7jS6vKp+jbmXw==","fsize":284418,"resto":581529693,"m_img":1},{"no":581530420,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:22:28","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p581530127\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581530127<\/a><br>if that&#039;s true then there is something very off-putting about you because i do not want to have sex with that creature at all for some reason. not even a single percentage point of increase in blood pressure. it&#039;s not even that you might be ugly. it&#039;s that you don&#039;t register at all.","time":1789777348,"resto":581529693},{"no":581530446,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:22:51","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p581530164\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581530164<\/a><br>TLT gets the same graphical update as Forever<br>Fogchads won.","